$$\lambda = h/p$$
(a) $$p = mv$$ so $$\lambda = (6.626 × 10^{-34} J s)/(10000kg * 27.8 m/s) = 2.4 × 10^{-36} m$$
(b) $$p = mv$$ so $$\lambda = (6.626 × 10^{-34} J s)/(50 × 10^{-6}kg * 1 m/s) = 1.3 × 10^{-26} m$$
